# Onboarding guardrails

[PASS] onboarding schema enforces the 18+ gate server-side
[PASS] save route derives the uid from the session, never the body
[PASS] profile, preferences, age declaration and audit are written atomically
[PASS] country, languages, regions and interests are allow-listed
[PASS] exact birth date is written only to the private user document
[PASS] edit onboarding draft is loaded server-side from profile + private DOB
